--- (iiia) which S4AIX file OPENS each season ---
    A289 / A326 ("months for the MAJOR / MINOR season of dominant
    crop") are asked ONCE per season, at the head of the season's
    labour sequence.  Whichever file carries them is the season's
    FIRST block, and the questionnaire heads the first block
    "LAND PREPARATION".  A swap of blocks 1 and 2 would put field
    management before the season had been dated.
    S4AIX1: season-month columns ['s4aix_289i', 's4aix_289ii']
